      "card_ids": ["C10"],
      "claim": "MP-10, the closest analogue (Morgan 0.4286), caused significant brain FDG uptake changes in monkey PET after systemic dosing, directly demonstrating meaningful CNS access; the query shares the same pyrazolyl-pyridinyl-phenyl ether core, so this supports a pass.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
